    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the incident of the N\u00e9ombre Rift, the Vermalian Lands have become hostile and are now inhabited by aggressive creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a group of explorers seeking answers in a cooperative adventure where every battle tests your individual strengths and your team's strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a beginner or an experienced player, the Vermalian Lands call to you! Accessible and engaging from the very first game, this card game quickly evolves into a demanding strategic adventure. Discover innovative mechanics, refine your strategies, and join forces to triumph in a journey as dark as it is intriguing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Les Nomin\u00e9es du N\u00e9ombre</strong> is a cooperative strategy card game set in a dark fantasy universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress from zone to zone and build your deck, you will face increasingly fierce opponents and earn loot to enhance your deck.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the incident of the N\u00e9ombre Rift, the Vermalian Lands have become hostile and are now inhabited by aggressive creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a group of explorers seeking answers in a cooperative adventure where every battle tests your individual strengths and your team's strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a beginner or an experienced player, the Vermalian Lands call to you! Accessible and engaging from the very first game, this card game quickly evolves into a demanding strategic adventure. Discover innovative mechanics, refine your strategies, and join forces to triumph in a journey as dark as it is intriguing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Les Nomin\u00e9es du N\u00e9ombre</strong> is a cooperative strategy card game set in a dark fantasy universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress from zone to zone and build your deck, you will face increasingly fierce opponents and earn loot to enhance your deck.</p>",
    "short_description": "Les Nomin\u00e9s du N\u00e9ombre is a cooperative and strategic card game where you play as a group of explorers embarking on a collective adventure. Each battle tests your strength in the Vermalian lands, which have turned hostile since the emergence of the N\u00e9ombre Rift.",
